shop_pistols|Weapons allowed: pistols|persist|mp_weapons_allow_pistols -1|mp_weapons_allow_pistols 0
shop_smgs|Weapons allowed: SMGs|persist|mp_weapons_allow_smgs -1|mp_weapons_allow_smgs 0
